{
  "_about": "KAN-801 — every `\"reason\": <expression>` in app/ that is neither a string literal nor a module-level constant. kind refusal: a refusal body's details.reason, each value translated in REASON_KEYS (apiRefusal.ts) or listed in notARefusalReasons.json; kind problem: a reassignment 422's details.problems[].reason, each value in userOptions.ts PROBLEM_REASONS; kind notARefusal: never a refusal body, and why. values are what tests/refusal_reason_values.py reads from the code (hints say how, for a form it cannot follow alone); tests/test_refusal_reason_value_sites.py keeps this file equal to the code. Keyed <path>::<function>::<expression>, no line numbers.",
